	<section_number>44-26</section_number>
	<catch_line>Location of units and headquarters</catch_line>
	<text>
		The Governor shall determine and fix the location of the units and headquarters of the National Guard within the Commonwealth.
	</text>
	<history>1930, p. 953; Michie Code 1942, § 2673(16); 1958, c. 393.</history>
